             diagonalize the excitation propagator, and the adjoints of which
             annihilate the reference state. The overall theoretical
             spectroscopy of the Be/sub 2/ molecule is qualitatively in
             agreement with experiment.},
  keywords = {Beryllium; GTO calculations; Molecular electronic states;
             Potential energy curves and surfaces of molecules; RPA
             calculations; SCF calculations; Transition moments; Triplet
             state; Transition moment; Ground state; AGP; AGP-TDA; SCF
